    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16194" root="رفق" body-key="r">
    
      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رافقهُ</span></b>  <i>He was,</i> or <i>became, his</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَفِيق</span>, or
<i>travelling-companion; he accompanied him in a
journey;</i> (S, O, Msb, K;) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُرَافَقَةٌ</span> (TK)
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِفَاقٌ</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And this latter inf. n. also
signifies The <i>being hypocritical,</i> or <i>acting hypocritically.</i> (TA. [See also 3 in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رمق</span>.])

